{"id":"d17f7fcd83c7b403","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NContextRow.md","title":"NContextRow","display":"NContextRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NContextRow","parameters":["z1593","z1594","z1595"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NContextRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1593</span><span>z1594</span><span>z1595</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命名项与开放等式。有序参数：<code>z1593</code>、<code>z1594</code>、<code>z1595</code>。</p>\n<p>恰有一个洞的命名上下文。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NContextRow z1593 z1594 z1595)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists c\n  (and\n    (= z1595 c)\n    (or\n      (@ NHole c)\n      (or\n        (exists z1598\n          (exists z1599\n            (and\n              (@ Nat z1598)\n              (and\n                (@ NLam z1598 z1599 c)\n                (exists z1601 (exists z1602 (and (in z1601 z1594) (and (@ App z1593 z1601 z1602) (= z1602 z1599)))))))))\n        (exists z1599\n          (exists z1600\n            (and\n              (@ NApp z1599 z1600 c)\n              (or\n                (and\n                  (exists z1603 (exists z1604 (and (in z1603 z1594) (and (@ App z1593 z1603 z1604) (= z1604 z1599)))))\n                  (@ NRaw z1600))\n                (and\n                  (@ NRaw z1599)\n                  (exists z1605 (exists z1606 (and (in z1605 z1594) (and (@ App z1593 z1605 z1606) (= z1606 z1600))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cff538dd049d418\" href=\"?note=3cff538dd049d418\" title=\"ZFC_NApp\">NApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5cc2a4ed5b3afc4\" href=\"?note=d5cc2a4ed5b3afc4\" title=\"ZFC_NHole\">NHole</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d7c6583016ee6af4\" href=\"?note=d7c6583016ee6af4\" title=\"ZFC_NLam\">NLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ba5bcae5363217b\" href=\"?note=5ba5bcae5363217b\" title=\"ZFC_NRaw\">NRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NContextRow z1593 z1594 z1595)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_NApp|NApp]]；[[ZFC_NHole|NHole]]；[[ZFC_NLam|NLam]]；[[ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NApp","status":"resolved","id":"3cff538dd049d418","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_NApp|NApp]]；[[ZFC_NHole|NHole]]；[[ZFC_NLam|NLam]]；[[ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NHole","status":"resolved","id":"d5cc2a4